cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Dark-Matter-Live, please cite it using this metadata.
title: Dark-Matter-Live
type: software
abstract: >-
  Dark-Matter-Live is a static website and dataset that provides interactive
  visualisations of published experimental and observational constraints on
  dark-matter models, enabling side-by-side comparison across experiments.
authors:
